Subject: [PATCH 08/10] Connect CCTV gateway to monitoring dashboard

---
 app/api/cctv/status/route.ts     |  29 ++++++++
 app/office/cameras/page.tsx      |  69 ++++++++++++++++-
 app/office/setup-wizard/page.tsx |   6 +-
